WEBVTT

00:53:59.125 --> 00:54:00.976
how do you articulate that?

00:54:01.000 --> 00:54:02.726
AG: I think about it in a few ways.

00:54:02.750 --> 00:54:05.393
One is, I think about,
well, not every part of my work.

00:54:05.417 --> 00:54:08.059
There are parts of my job
that I'm not passionate about.

00:54:08.083 --> 00:54:10.601
I've tried to design those
out of it over time,

00:54:10.625 --> 00:54:12.601
but some of them are kind of stuck.

00:54:12.625 --> 00:54:15.018
When I think about the parts
I'm passionate about,

00:54:15.042 --> 00:54:18.518
I think about waking up in the morning,
looking forward to starting work,

00:54:18.542 --> 00:54:22.059
going to bed at night, thinking about
all the cool ideas I get to explore

00:54:22.083 --> 00:54:25.434
and all the amazing, talented, inspiring
students I get to learn from,

00:54:25.458 --> 00:54:27.184
and maybe try to help a little bit.

00:54:27.208 --> 00:54:28.726
And that for me is energizing,

00:54:28.750 --> 00:54:33.434
and I guess it's exciting in the way